      "description": "The Maturity Method is a zero-to-one-hundred methodology by Erika Hanafin Austria that scores how recommendable a brand is to AI across six dimensions (Foundation, Endorsement, Alignment, Presence, Warmth, Constancy), a five-band maturity ladder (Unseen, Surfacing, Standing, Trusted, The Answer), and the Intent Category Framework of ten intent categories, measured on all five major engines."
