        "url": "https://signllabs.ai/"
      },
      "description": "AI Signaling is the practice of engineering how AI understands, trusts, and recommends a brand. Answer engines do not rank pages, they synthesize an answer and name a few brands. AI Signaling is the work of becoming one of the names, driven mostly through earned media, which accounts for roughly 82 to 84 percent of AI citations."
